<https://heatflow.world/vocabularies/heat-flow-method/bootstrap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Iterative procedure aimed at minimize the difference between the measured and modelled temperatures by solving the 1-D steady-state conductive geotherm (radiogenic heat production of rocks is accounted for)"@en .
